    ASSERT.C.05 · `@indirect_dispatch fn cmd_gen() -> DispatchArgs { ... }` ; dispatch args written by GPU ·
                   consumed by GPU · NO CPU round-trip (per spec/63 item-33)
    ASSERT.C.06 · `Queue::Graphics · Queue::Compute · Queue::Copy` first-class · concurrent dispatch
                   with cross-queue semaphore (per spec/63 item-34 + spec/65 § cross-queue-semaphores)
    ASSERT.C.07 · `@shared struct Camera { pos : vec3 ; vp : mat4 }` declares once · CPU + GPU use same layout
