    ASSERT.C.08 · `@vram_direct let buf : gpu<f32>` ReBAR-aware · CPU writes straight to VRAM
                   (per spec/63 item-28 · merged-w/ v1-item-36)
    ASSERT.C.09 · `wave_ballot(active)` · `active_sum(x)` · `shuffle(v · lane)` · `prefix_sum(x)` recognized
